              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "We ũla ũtavasya Saioni maũvoo maseo, ambata kĩĩmanĩ kĩtũlu; we ũla ũtavasya Yelusaleme maũvoo maseo, ũkĩlya wasya waku na vinya; wũkĩlye, ndũkakĩe; tavya ndũa sya Yuta, Sisyai, Ngai wenyu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.9"
            ]
          }
        },
